# Only package inputs and selected test fixtures enter the build context. Terraform
# state, transcripts and the developer virtual environment stay outside it.
**
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
!src/**
!prompts/
!prompts/**

!tests/
!tests/__init__.py
!tests/validation/
!tests/validation/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

!tests/azure/
!tests/azure/**
